To bound $A/\la,C/\la$, we consider the lines $\ell_k(z):=s_k z+r_k$ going from the point $(z_\infty,V_{b_n}(z_\infty))$ to the peak $(p_k/q_k,\mu_{\bE_k}(p_k/q_k))$ of the $k$th obstruction.  

