The stationary distribution corresponding to any such $\kbar$ can be solved similarly by solving the $\binom{\kbar}{2}+2\kbar + 2$ equations in $\binom{\kbar}{2}+2\kbar + 1$ unknowns. We have used programming to solve for the stationary distribution given any value of the threshold and any $p$.

