    \centering
    \includegraphics[width=0.85\linewidth]{Figures/bvmAddsim.png}
    \caption{Simulation result for the multiplication of 11$_d$ $\times$ 13$_d$ following the QB outputs shown in Fig. \ref{fig:bvmMult}. The pulses for both the T1 input and output are detected through $J_1$ within T1 and the JJs in the JTLs connected to T1.}
