    \rowcolor{lightpink} Conspiracy/Junk Science & 10 & Unreliable & Domains providing systematically manipulative and fabricated content with the purpose of legitimizing implausible conceptualizations of facts and knowledge through argumentative methods that coarsely mimic those of scientific reasoning but without any sound logical or factual basis, targeting individuals or social groups as covert instigators or perpetrators of harmful actions.\\ 
