% First, the components $D_i$ of the decomposition of anticanonical divisor, together with their intersection form the so-called {\it surface sublattice} which we denote by $Q=\operatorname{Span}_{\mathbb{Z}} \left\{D_1,...,D_{28} \right\}$. 
