\end{equation*}
The initial and final values of the first and third products can be updated to remove the $+1$ from the indices, resulting in:
\begin{equation*}
    \mathcal{S}(\Wt_{n}) = \sum_{k=1}^{n}(\prod_{i=2}^{(k+1)-1}(\prj{1_{t_{i}}}) \cdot \prj{0_{t_{k+1}}} \cdot \prod_{i=n-k}^{n-2}(\bev(q,(n+1)-i)\unSem{s}) \cdot \bev(q,2)) + \prod_{i=2}^{n+1}\prj{1_{t_{i}}} \cdot \prod_{i=0}^{n-1}\unSem{s}\bev(q,(n+1)-i).
\end{equation*}
Finally, the $k+1$ can be collected, and the summation indices can be updated, resulting in:
\begin{equation*}
