The rest of the paper is organized as follows.
In Section \ref{sec:GE}, we define the GE in a finite population and explain its decomposability in detail.
We also describe the usefulness of the GE compared to the Gini coefficient using a toy example.
In Section \ref{sec:Estimation}, we propose an estimation method for decomposition of the GE based on grouped data.
Its extension to a multilevel decomposition is explained in Section \ref{sec:multilevel}.
